Z||000000||SN1PERVII||11-29-1999||12:51 PM||||     Hey yall. i have been thinking lately about autocross racing. I would like to get either a fiero to race with or an older 280z/300z. I realy like the whole rear engine thing but i belive that i would be able to get more power out of the nissan. i have been talking with a friend of mine who says that the stock 280z rear end will handle upto 500hp seems a little high to me but he sais he has done it.  The fiero seems to be a little lower and wider to my untrained eye and I thought that is might corner better.<BR>most important whight can i be most competitive with for the least money??? Auto-zone pays OK but i dont want to compleatly break the budget.||||reg||5
